397c5b6f70a0e332049d","logical_entry_identity":"c535065f04a8176590ec07ffdfeb4050c49c824c89b253b502cd239a99bb3b05","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"We'll see. [Leave]","source_tag":"_t","target":"再说吧。[离开]"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"81bd357fe6bc194d4a8d77e73c6f6e37bc1a985659e8295cd9e8bb60661853a2","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"a2198543efcacc93cc458c2463e6314a7185ae4e1a147e0e811118144402e803","logical_entry_identity":"797efd7e6a76d5cbd7cb99e440ddfcc57598732f314fa7be1f2b947a9fb7672a","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Long ago the Sher'tuls used farportals not only for transportation to known locations, but also to explore new parts of the world, or even other worlds.\nThis Fortress is equipped with an exploratory farportal, and now has enough energy to allow one teleportation. Each teleportation will take you to a random part of the universe and use 45 energy.\nBeware that the return portal may not be nearby your arrival point; you will need to find it. You can use the rod of recall to try to force an emergency recall, but it has high chances of breaking the exploratory farportal forever.\nYou may use the farportal; however, beware - I sense a strange presence in the farportal room.","source_tag":"_t","target":"很久以前，夏·图尔使用远行传送门不仅是为了前往已知地点，还会用它探索世界的未知区域，甚至其他世界。\n这座堡垒配备了一座探索用远行传送门，现在已有足够能量进行一次传送。每次传送都会把你送往宇宙中的随机区域，并消耗 45 点能量。\n注意，返回传送门可能不在抵达点附近，你需要自行寻找。紧急情况下，你可以用回归之杖强制返回，但这很可能会永久损坏探索用远行传送门。\n你现在可以使用这座远行传送门；不过要小心——我感觉传送门房间里有某种异常存在。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"1f5e558b6362563de0e206cd8c0e1961ef3f3ac92289ce10749dab9ce52cbee8","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"a21f3cd4f56305f80a2def307c26ce379560915b397438090d85bda4f6f98e96","logical_entry_identity":"56ea9c16cce34d6243a42c5d46a5540c8fa216cf07e82603a2e2008b5b5fff2f","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Though tarnished and spattered with blood, the emblem of the Sun still manages to shine through on this shield.","source_tag":"_t","target":"尽管这面盾牌已经失去光泽、溅满鲜血，太阳的徽记依然闪耀其上。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"6004ca419172d9e01559bbf75e3fc37af4151aac1a74477d9c52c2d7b97cfab0","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"a2208ed3bc6d7ae7be56665948854f20780cb198fcea43f69da01316f993ab93","logical_entry_identity":"e5b943689de2fd3bf30da449de76794d52c2aec298ca6890f1fc64b230872881","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Whatever wins the day, wins the day.","source_tag":"_t","target":"只要能赢，什么手段都行。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"0fdc5667789dca2bc3881b2e7e1c1d09dce3e5af6b3b671c8f403ebb4808adaf","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"a221258968459781a7974899135e7541f58bbb995a9ee86731a2cb7e9b9af366","logical_entry_identity":"ed8de3341b634bcb224b25d75a9fb11cc5e501a4e9d9837ba3fc7b3c2e14a8ef","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Move to normal inventory","source_tag":"_t","target":"移动到普通物品栏"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"31c136f7a34175e4d9822a3a5d6b7be29c83cd0c5ff65bdfd405590798f50b2b","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"a2247c18cf457dc8676e8169893907077d874c01da183f96fc5a3d818c50f15f","logical_entry_identity":"21f075995cc524ccc97b02c2cbcb02f95bc84b2e0760806acd373351fd23535b","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"An old and powerful corrosive venom drake, armed with deadly breath and nasty claws.","source_tag":"_t","target":"一条年长且强大的毒龙，拥有致命的吐息和锋利的爪子。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"ca8af03375d5737d428b48389bf3292439e02e08e399f5d9dc5faec13d3f8d7c","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"a227a5db9a9923c86a3ee6b30c924ab738c409f75d27a70e872a0e91a79fa507","logical_entry_identity":"5826bdaff2ae19432da6e73b2e41ebf28c619236e634d2738ea22828379a115f","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Dirge Acolyte","source_tag":"talent name","target":"挽歌入门"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"3276dbdf078bce8b11e681bb0e4b265df833fec98cfc02f4a435d3dda4bae030","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"a22c51517e4ea41feb23caf69002a195c2218c8477761b72fd12f0f361231640","logical_entry_identity":"713c